{"id":3385,"date":"2022-05-02T10:44:58","date_gmt":"2022-05-02T08:44:58","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/?p=3385"},"modified":"2022-05-02T20:07:46","modified_gmt":"2022-05-02T18:07:46","slug":"nvp-2022-talks-and-poster-sessions","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/nvp-2022-talks-and-poster-sessions\/","title":{"rendered":"NVP 2022 talks and posters"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It was so wonderful to meet in person again at NVP 2022 in Egmond aan Zee April 28-30. Simone Dobbelaar presented her work on \u201c<strong>Retaliatory responses in childhood: an fMRI test-replication design<\/strong>\u201d.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"643\" height=\"402\" data-id=\"3409\" src=\"http:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Simone-edited.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3409\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Simone-edited.jpg 643w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Simone-edited-550x344.jpg 550w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Simone-edited-210x131.jpg 210w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 643px) 100vw, 643px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Furthermore we share our posters here:<br><br>Lina van Drunen presented her poster on \u201c<strong>Music alters brain development: A longitudinal twin study on sensorimotor synchronization and brain plasticity<\/strong>\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" data-id=\"3387\" src=\"http:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-1440x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3387\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-1440x1080.jpg 1440w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-550x413.jpg 550w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-210x158.jpg 210w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Lina-copy-scaled.jpg 2560w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1527\" height=\"1080\" data-id=\"3394\" src=\"http:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/NVP_Poster_Lina_music_brain-1527x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3394\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/NVP_Poster_Lina_music_brain-1527x1080.jpg 1527w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/NVP_Poster_Lina_music_brain-550x389.jpg 550w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/NVP_Poster_Lina_music_brain-210x148.jpg 210w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/NVP_Poster_Lina_music_brain-768x543.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/NVP_Poster_Lina_music_brain-1536x1086.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/NVP_Poster_Lina_music_brain.jpg 1683w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1527px) 100vw, 1527px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mara van der Meulen talked about <strong>\u201cGrowing up prosocially? Longitudinal trajectoreis of prosocial behavior from middle childhood into adolescence\u201d<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" data-id=\"3406\" src=\"http:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3406\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-550x309.jpg 550w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-210x118.jpg 210w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mara-copy-2-edited-2048x1152.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1527\" height=\"1080\" data-id=\"3407\" src=\"http:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/vanderMeulen_NVP2022_LongitudinalPCG_final-3-1527x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3407\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/vanderMeulen_NVP2022_LongitudinalPCG_final-3-1527x1080.jpg 1527w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/vanderMeulen_NVP2022_LongitudinalPCG_final-3-550x389.jpg 550w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/vanderMeulen_NVP2022_LongitudinalPCG_final-3-210x148.jpg 210w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/vanderMeulen_NVP2022_LongitudinalPCG_final-3-768x543.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/vanderMeulen_NVP2022_LongitudinalPCG_final-3-1536x1086.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/vanderMeulen_NVP2022_LongitudinalPCG_final-3.jpg 1683w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1527px) 100vw, 1527px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Michelle Achterberg presented a poster on <strong>\u201cLongitudinal associations between social media use, mental well-being and structural brain development across adolescence\u201d <\/strong><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1528\" height=\"1080\" data-id=\"3403\" src=\"http:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Achterberg_220425_poster_NVP_landscape-1528x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3403\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Achterberg_220425_poster_NVP_landscape-1528x1080.jpg 1528w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Achterberg_220425_poster_NVP_landscape-550x389.jpg 550w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Achterberg_220425_poster_NVP_landscape-210x148.jpg 210w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Achterberg_220425_poster_NVP_landscape-768x543.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Achterberg_220425_poster_NVP_landscape-1536x1086.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/Achterberg_220425_poster_NVP_landscape-2048x1448.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/www.developmentmatters.nl\/wp-content\/upload